flowchart TD
    Start(["Autopilot Start"]) --> FetchData["Read latest_pose<br/>from VisionWorker"]
    
    %% Core Validation Block
    FetchData --> Check{Is Pose Valid?}
    
    Check -->|No / Low Conf| Search["SEARCH Phase<br/>Yaw ±15°/s to find ring"]
    Search --> FetchData %% Cycle back to read fresh frames
    
    Check -->|Yes| Align{Is Ring Centered?<br/>X & Y error < threshold}
    
    %% Alignment Loop
    Align -->|No| AlignPhase["ALIGN Phase<br/>Adjust roll/pitch/yaw<br/>Hold Z = 160cm"]
    AlignPhase --> FetchData %% Cycle back to check new position
    
    %% Approach Loop
    Align -->|Yes| App{Is Distance Close?<br/>Z < 80cm}
    App -->|No| AppPhase["APPROACH Phase<br/>Pitch forward<br/>Maintain X/Y alignment"]
    AppPhase --> FetchData %% Cycle back to verify tracking while moving
    
    %% Terminal Punch Phase
    App -->|Yes| Punch["PUNCH Phase<br/>Commit maximum forward speed<br/>Blind forward thrust (2.5s)"]
    Punch --> Done["DONE Phase<br/>Kill/idle motors safely"]
    Done --> End(["Flight Complete"])

    %% Style Tweaks
    style Start fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    style End fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style Punch fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
    style Check fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    style Align fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    style App fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
